# Cloud Sync (Google Drive appDataFolder)
#
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials, create an OAuth 2.0 Client ID of
#    type "Web application".
# 2. Add this app's dev/prod origins (e.g. http://localhost:5173 and your GitHub Pages URL) to
#    "Authorized JavaScript origins". No redirect URI is needed — Cloud Sync uses Google Identity
#    Services' token flow, not a redirect-based OAuth flow.
# 3. Enable the "Google Drive API" for the project.
# 4. Paste the Client ID below. Cloud Sync stays hidden in Settings until this is set.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
